{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgXdWzUV2ZyLqNNMgEykZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's a plan built on what your memory holds about Mila.\n\n**What I know**\n- Her birthday is the evening of 11 November (a Wednesday), 12 days away.\n- She wants something quiet, just the two of you.\n- She likes the small jazz trio club (about 60 seats) and dislikes big open-air festivals.\n- No peanuts.\n- Her mother Vesna is staying for two weeks from last Monday's arrival, so she'll probably still be there on the 11th.\n\n**Suggested evening**\n1. **Early:** Vesna covers the house, or goes out herself, so you two leave alone. This is the part that makes it \"just us\".\n2. **Dinner:** a small, quiet restaurant with a table for two. When you book, tell them about the peanut allergy. Ask for a corner or window table.\n3. **After dinner:** the jazz trio club if they play that night. With only 60 seats, book ahead.\n4. **Home:** a small gift and a dessert, with no peanuts in it.\n\n**Next steps**\n- Check whether the club has a show on Wednesday 11 November, and book it this week.\n- Book the restaurant.\n- Set the reminders you wanted, a week before (4 Nov) and a day before (10 Nov). I can't set them from here, so tell me if you want them somewhere specific.\n\n**Questions**\n- Is Vesna fine staying home or making herself scarce that evening?\n- What's your budget, and which part of town?\n- Do you have a gift in mind, or should I suggest some?\n\nIf you tell me the city, I can search for jazz clubs and restaurants with dates and availability."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12348,"cache_read_input_tokens":17257,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12348},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transforma